me</h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\">Residents of a care home in Poole will be treated to performances from professional musicians from the BSO.</p><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\">1 hr ago</span></p></div></div></div></a></div><div data-testid=\"liverpool-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/videos/c7vqp6e3jezo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\"><div><div><p><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\">7 hrs ago</span></p></div><div data-testid=\"liverpool-video\"><div data-testid=\"card-media-wrapper\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\"><p><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260409-151157-6d668e92bf-web-3.1.0-1/grey-placeholder.png\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1008px) 25vw, (min-width: 600px) 33vw, 50vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/9f82/live/0c22acc0-3e79-11f1-b55d-0f258dce1735.jpg.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Splitscreen. Left, Ringo Starr smiles. Right, Paul McCartney and Ringo Starr as the Beatles.\"></p></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\"><div><p><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\">Ringo Starr talks Beatles, Barry Keoghan and country music </h2></p></div><p data-testid=\"card-